Homepage: https://github.com/Faded-Dream-Project/FDK
Description: Layer-shell surfaces (panels, docks, overlays) for FDK — runtime
 fdk-shell is the first add-on package built on FDK's extension API
 (fdk/extend.h): panel/bar/notification-style surfaces that live
 outside the normal window stack — desktop background layers, docks,
 top bars, overlays — behind one API on both FDK backends (Wayland
 wlr-layer-shell v4; X11 dock windows with strut reservations).
 .
 This package carries the fdk-shell runtime: the shared library
 (libfdk-shell.so.0). It depends on the FDK runtime with the version
 that introduced the extension API it is built against — the
 documented add-on versioning pattern (docs/EXTENDING.md).
 .
 The FDK and fdk-shell runtimes are installed separately by the end
 user per the FDK Proprietary License, Section 4(d); applications
 built with them remain the property of their authors.
